  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 2111.01 Requirements for Slaughter Swine. The requirements for slaughter swine shall be the same as for slaughter cattle, as set forth in Agr 2105.\n\nSource. #4546, eff 12-16-88, EXPIRED 12-16-94\n\nNew. #6011, eff 3-28-95; ss by #6959, eff 3-23-99; ss by #8423, eff 8-31-05; ss by #8848, eff 3-21-07, EXPIRED: 3-21-15 (from Agr 2110.01)\n\nNew. #10975, eff 11-19-15\n\nNew. #14570, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-4-26, EXPIRES: 10-31-26",
